{
  "_about": "Hugging Face Hub dataset searches for Hebrew. mode 'tag' = Hebrew language tag + one task category + one sort: the firehose, mostly multilingual datasets (C4, Wikipedia, Common Voice). mode 'name' = dataset ids containing 'heb' (also matches 'hebrew'), any task: the specialist lane, since many Hebrew datasets set no task category. scripts/snapshot.py runs them; web_url is the same search in the browser. Add a permutation by adding an entry; ids are <task-short>-<sort> or <short>-name.",
  "api_notes": "Datasets use filter=language:he and filter=task_categories:<task> (repeatable, ANDed). On 2026-11-18 filter=language:he alone hit the 1000 cap led by allenai/c4 and wikimedia/wikipedia; with task_categories:automatic-speech-recognition it returned 72; search=hebrew returned 229.",
